  "rules": [
    "hosted or QEMU timing must not be relabeled as SSC305 silicon timing",
    "direct allocator symbol absence proves no direct malloc/calloc/realloc/free dependency in the linked pipeline/runtime libraries; it is not a whole-process libc allocation count",
    "algorithmic latency is not the same as adaptive warmup or convergence time",
    "effect-first remains research-only until an acoustic benefit and all S004 evidence gates are independently satisfied",
    "caller_owned_state_bytes is pipeline plus runtime arenas only; exclude thread stacks, external PCM queues, libc/application state and optional Flight Recorder memory from this measurement, not from product budgeting",
